 HELP ASSOCIATES PROVIDE BETTER CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE', 'text': "ATLANTA , JAN. 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HOME DEPOT® \xa0IS ROLLING OUT A NEW, HOMEGROWN APP DEVELOPED TO HELP STORE ASSOCIATES PRIORITIZE TASKS MORE EFFECTIVELY. THE APP, DUBBED SIDEKICK, IS A NEW ADDITION TO HDPHONES, THE HOME DEPOT'S MOBILE DEVICES DEDICATED TO IMPROVING THE ASSOCIATE AND CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE."}{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2023-01-12 16:00:00', 'title': 'INTUIT ANNOUNCES ANNUAL STOCKHOLDER MEETING', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--INTUIT INC. (NASDAQ: INTU), THE GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM THAT MAKES TURBOTAX, CREDIT KARMA, QUICKBOOKS, AND MAILCHIMP, WILL HOLD ITS ANNUAL STOCKHOLDER MEETING VIRTUALLY ON THURSDAY, JANUARY 19 AT 8 AM PACIFIC TIME (11:00 AM EASTERN TIME).'}{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2023-01-12 02:35:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF INTUIT, INC. - INTU', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0INTUIT, INC.\xa0("INTUIT" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0INTU).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2023-01-12 07:35:00', 'title': 'INTUITIVE MACHINES TEAMS WITH JACOBS TO SUPPORT NASA JETS II CONTRACT', 'text': "HOUSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--INTUITIVE MACHINES, LLC (“INTUITIVE MACHINES” OR THE “COMPANY”), A LEADING SPACE EXPLORATION, INFRASTRUCTURE, AND SERVICES COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL WORK ALONGSIDE JACOBS SOLUTIONS INC. (“JACOBS”) (NYSE: J) TO SAFELY AND SUCCESSFULLY ACCOMPLISH THE GOALS AND CONTRACTUAL REQUIREMENTS WITHIN NASA'S JOHNSON SPACE CENTER ENGINEERING, TECHNOLOGY, AND SCIENCE (JETS) II CONTRACT."}{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2023-01-12 16:15:00', 'title': 'KEYCORP DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON COMMON SHARES AND PREFERRED STOCKS; SETS ANNUAL MEETING DATE', 'text': "CLEVELAND , JAN. 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BO